            {
              "label": "changes in horizontal fixation are accomplished by a head thrust that overshoots the target",
              "children": [
                {
                  "label": "initial thrust serves to break fixation",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "label": "followed by a rotation of the head back in the opposite direction once fixation is established"
